   "name": "One writer per fact",
   "repairs": [
    "SYS-I1"
   ],
   "rule": "Each kind of stored fact has one owning mechanism, and every write of that fact goes through it, with the owner's checks.",
   "formal": "for every store s and every write step w: writes(w) contains s => w is a method of owner(s), or w calls owner(s) with owner(s)'s guards",
   "repair_note": "SYS-I1 named the owner but not the guards; a writer that writes the owned store directly, or calls the owner while skipping its checks (identity, mark, kind), is the same defect (F-0602, F-0603, F-1107).",
